      "writtenOn": "2017-01-10T00:01:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we document the fact that, during deserialization, incoming data is not validated in any way? In particular:\n\n  - A malformed Parcel may cause a RuntimeException, during deserialization.\n  - Even if the Parcel deserializes without error, the values of the fields are not guaranteed to be meaningful. (E.g. frequency could be 9999.)",
